Title: F1-M08 — The Long Night (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. FORWARD COMMAND POST - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(serious)
Hold the plateau until dawn. The relief column says it will approach from the east.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

MIRA
(measured)
That signal matches the enemy's old cipher. We cannot assume it is genuine.

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(firm)
Defend the plateau, verify the relief signal, and keep the western pass open. If the eastern column is hostile, do not chase it into the valley.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
